(6556426, 976837, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, this could be a splendid image.  Good lighting good definition.  Composition is the culprit here (IMO, of course)  If you deleted the coastline on the left - and started with the lighthouse, lead towards the building and then the more interesting coastline to the right, and maybe remove some of that not very interesting sky, and some of the water, this could be a strong, fine picture.  It would still show the isolation that is so important here and draw attention to the fine architecture and lighting.  <br/> <br/>Okay, sorry to write a ''book'' but this image intrigued me.  I hope this is helpful to you.<br/>:)</td>', 'Oh, this could be a splendid image.  Good lighting good definition.  Composition is the culprit here (IMO, of course)  If you deleted the coastline on the left - and started with the lighthouse, lead towards the building and then the more interesting coastline to the right, and maybe remove some of that not very interesting sky, and some of the water, this could be a strong, fine picture.  It would still show the isolation that is so important here and draw attention to the fine architecture and lighting.   Okay, sorry to write a ''book'' but this image intrigued me.  I hope this is helpful to you.:)', '2011-10-01 01:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6556427, 975066, 37252, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, but over all the image seems a bit flat to me. I don''t feel any depth in this. I do like the composition however, and the sun just peeking over the mountains</td>', 'Lovely colors, but over all the image seems a bit flat to me. I don''t feel any depth in this. I do like the composition however, and the sun just peeking over the mountains', '2011-10-01 01:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
