(6556507, 975066, 94241, '<td valign="top">I think this needs a wider (more cinematic) crop.  Like I personally would probably cut the bottom foreground out completely.<br/> <br/>That said, I recognize the DPC limit on pixel width makes really cinematic crops hard to get away with.<br/> <br/>Either way, this image has gorgeous tones and colors, especially down that river valley.  Well done.  :)</td>', 'I think this needs a wider (more cinematic) crop.  Like I personally would probably cut the bottom foreground out completely. That said, I recognize the DPC limit on pixel width makes really cinematic crops hard to get away with. Either way, this image has gorgeous tones and colors, especially down that river valley.  Well done.  :)', '2011-10-01 02:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
