(6556947, 975433, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  He looks a bit bright, and like he''s squinting into the sun.  I think I''d try to shoot this from a much lower angle with a wide angle lens to make him look even larger in comparison to the background.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  He looks a bit bright, and like he''s squinting into the sun.  I think I''d try to shoot this from a much lower angle with a wide angle lens to make him look even larger in comparison to the background.', '2011-10-01 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
