(6559221, 974944, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of leaving the haze and not stripping that out in post. It''s a powerful image, and like this it''s more realistic, natural, earthy. It would not be so powerful on it''s own. The placement of your sidekick ads depth and emotion.</td>', 'I like your choice of leaving the haze and not stripping that out in post. It''s a powerful image, and like this it''s more realistic, natural, earthy. It would not be so powerful on it''s own. The placement of your sidekick ads depth and emotion.', '2011-10-03 12:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
