(6559595, 974830, 115307, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.<br/>This is my favorite image in this month''s Free Study. The whole picture looks like a painting instead of a photograph and I think that is wonderful. The dog is backlit perfectly and I love the texture in the water.<br/>Very well done! I will be looking forward to the end of the challenge to see who took this beauty!</td>', 'Back to comment.This is my favorite image in this month''s Free Study. The whole picture looks like a painting instead of a photograph and I think that is wonderful. The dog is backlit perfectly and I love the texture in the water.Very well done! I will be looking forward to the end of the challenge to see who took this beauty!', '2011-10-03 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
