(6561735, 976021, 113142, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the model''s actions/expression, but the editing artifacts are distracting. Also, a more shallow DOF to blur out the background might be suggested.</td>', 'I like the concept and the model''s actions/expression, but the editing artifacts are distracting. Also, a more shallow DOF to blur out the background might be suggested.', '2011-10-05 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
