(6563685, 976804, 75713, '<td valign="top">I love this!  My mind is filled with so many stories as I view the robust bud and the drooping flowers, already spent.  The textures in the leaves remind me of the resiliency of some plants to withstand my lack of a green thumb.  I can''t vote on this but wish I could as I would give it a 9 with no hesitation .. the composition, lighting, and the pping all appeal to my tastes.</td>', 'I love this!  My mind is filled with so many stories as I view the robust bud and the drooping flowers, already spent.  The textures in the leaves remind me of the resiliency of some plants to withstand my lack of a green thumb.  I can''t vote on this but wish I could as I would give it a 9 with no hesitation .. the composition, lighting, and the pping all appeal to my tastes.', '2011-10-07 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
