(6563997, 976785, 20799, '<td valign="top">I love Niall''s comment :).<br/>Seriously, you''ve described my own thoughts when entering a challenge. That leaning back and looking at your image... I hate that :).<br/>Still, great texture. I don''t know about brighter, but maybe it needs to be sharper and more saturated? Just a thought.</td>', 'I love Niall''s comment :).Seriously, you''ve described my own thoughts when entering a challenge. That leaning back and looking at your image... I hate that :).Still, great texture. I don''t know about brighter, but maybe it needs to be sharper and more saturated? Just a thought.', '2011-10-08 06:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
