(6564015, 976837, 12611, '<td valign="top">This image is big and serene. Many lighthouse shots seek the dramatic, while this gives a feeling of no storm but peace. For that it says a lot about the photog, and the atypical message conveyed to the viewer. I like the near centered placement of the lighthouse, it adds a stillness.</td>', 'This image is big and serene. Many lighthouse shots seek the dramatic, while this gives a feeling of no storm but peace. For that it says a lot about the photog, and the atypical message conveyed to the viewer. I like the near centered placement of the lighthouse, it adds a stillness.', '2011-10-08 07:22:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6564016, 971369, 12611, '<td valign="top">The lighting and nails are both good touches.</td>', 'The lighting and nails are both good touches.', '2011-10-08 07:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6564017, 973066, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great urban feel.love the frenetic busyness and detail. The blue-green color range is very pleasing.</td>', 'Great urban feel.love the frenetic busyness and detail. The blue-green color range is very pleasing.', '2011-10-08 07:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
