(6564023, 974810, 20799, '<td valign="top">Location undisclosed :). Brilliant scene... I love the light.</td>', 'Location undisclosed :). Brilliant scene... I love the light.', '2011-10-08 07:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6564024, 976682, 12930, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> The Seaview? I used to love <i>"Voyage to the Bottom of the Sea"</i>! Great show. I don''t see the Seaview in this shot, however. Must still be submerged. I''ll take your word that it is there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>In the UK,at the coast, many small hotels and B&amp;B''s are named "Sea View" , this was a play on the words for the cemetary.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: The Seaview? I used to love "Voyage to the Bottom of the Sea"! Great show. I don''t see the Seaview in this shot, however. Must still be submerged. I''ll take your word that it is there.   In the UK,at the coast, many small hotels and B&B''s are named "Sea View" , this was a play on the words for the cemetary.', '2011-10-08 07:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6564025, 972947, 20799, '<td valign="top">We had airshows on the same day! :) No F16s here, though.<br/>Great shot, the clouds give depth that''s missing on most airshow photos.</td>', 'We had airshows on the same day! :) No F16s here, though.Great shot, the clouds give depth that''s missing on most airshow photos.', '2011-10-08 07:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
