(6565594, 971062, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great finish, Mike! Sharp and clear, classy bridge shot. <br/>I don''t know the camera settings, but looking at the lights, maybe you could try using a higher aperture value to make them more star-like? :) Also, I would personally go for a thicker border. Just some thoughts, I hope it helps... great shot in any case.</td>', 'Great finish, Mike! Sharp and clear, classy bridge shot. I don''t know the camera settings, but looking at the lights, maybe you could try using a higher aperture value to make them more star-like? :) Also, I would personally go for a thicker border. Just some thoughts, I hope it helps... great shot in any case.', '2011-10-10 15:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
