(6565597, 975784, 72670, '<td valign="top">Mark<br/> <br/>Great setting and I like the idea of the flash. It works well with the background lights. My thoughts would be to have a more interesting subject in front with the flash. Maybe that''s why it ended up where it is.<br/> <br/>L</td>', 'Mark Great setting and I like the idea of the flash. It works well with the background lights. My thoughts would be to have a more interesting subject in front with the flash. Maybe that''s why it ended up where it is. L', '2011-10-10 15:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
