(6566266, 976418, 101117, '<td valign="top">In response to your thread, I would probably have scored this 5, perhaps lower. To me the picture is lacking interest. I have no connection with the child, so like others have said, it feels like a family snapshot.<br/> <br/>The ball is also just in the way, it serves no context, if you were at the beach for instance, that would be different, but as it stands it''s just a colourful out of focus toy taking attention away from the main subject.<br/> <br/>Eye contact is also important, a close to impossible task with children I know, but it also contributes to the lack of interest / connection people felt with the shot.</td>', 'In response to your thread, I would probably have scored this 5, perhaps lower. To me the picture is lacking interest. I have no connection with the child, so like others have said, it feels like a family snapshot. The ball is also just in the way, it serves no context, if you were at the beach for instance, that would be different, but as it stands it''s just a colourful out of focus toy taking attention away from the main subject. Eye contact is also important, a close to impossible task with children I know, but it also contributes to the lack of interest / connection people felt with the shot.', '2011-10-11 15:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6566786, 976338, 47470, '<td valign="top">The mood, the light, and the color here remind me of the series JoeyL did in Moldova.  It''s beautiful.</td>', 'The mood, the light, and the color here remind me of the series JoeyL did in Moldova.  It''s beautiful.', '2011-10-12 08:45:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6566794, 976661, 67697, '<td valign="top">Your skyline shots are usually pretty spectacular, and this one is no exception.  What a great night to get a shot like this.  I love that sky!</td>', 'Your skyline shots are usually pretty spectacular, and this one is no exception.  What a great night to get a shot like this.  I love that sky!', '2011-10-12 09:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6566877, 976681, 2337, '<td valign="top">This was the lowest scoring image that I gave a 10...  IMO, you were robbed...</td>', 'This was the lowest scoring image that I gave a 10...  IMO, you were robbed...', '2011-10-12 10:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6567034, 971566, 134120, '<td valign="top">thanks.  i always miss the deadlines for these things.  I scrambled to pick a picture since I only took like 10 pictures on my vacation and this happened to be one of them.  Thanks for the comments, I don''t think i even edited this picture.</td>', 'thanks.  i always miss the deadlines for these things.  I scrambled to pick a picture since I only took like 10 pictures on my vacation and this happened to be one of them.  Thanks for the comments, I don''t think i even edited this picture.', '2011-10-12 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6567049, 976852, 132967, '<td valign="top">I love hummingbirds and I especially love this shot!  Colors are beautiful and I like how you captured the hummingbird without the blur of the wings.  I''m jealous!  :-)</td>', 'I love hummingbirds and I especially love this shot!  Colors are beautiful and I like how you captured the hummingbird without the blur of the wings.  I''m jealous!  :-)', '2011-10-12 13:23:55.000000', NULL, 0),
