(6580150, 976418, 86090, '<td valign="top">I thinks is a lovely picture, I do agree with other about the ball taking attention away from her. I have taken lots of pictures of my daughter, she is 2 years old, and I know how hard is to get that eye contact with the camera, though most of the time I''ll try to get her looking at the camera, there are some other pictures, like this one, I think even without that eye contact it shows off her sweetnes and personality at that point in her life. So bottom line, Great work!</td>', 'I thinks is a lovely picture, I do agree with other about the ball taking attention away from her. I have taken lots of pictures of my daughter, she is 2 years old, and I know how hard is to get that eye contact with the camera, though most of the time I''ll try to get her looking at the camera, there are some other pictures, like this one, I think even without that eye contact it shows off her sweetnes and personality at that point in her life. So bottom line, Great work!', '2011-10-31 15:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6580258, 976257, 97225, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 in the challenge, but much, MUCH, prefer your original out of the camera with its stronger blues and deeper shadows.</td>', 'I gave you a 7 in the challenge, but much, MUCH, prefer your original out of the camera with its stronger blues and deeper shadows.', '2011-10-31 19:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
