(6919868, 976699, 10785, '<td valign="top">Greeting from the <b>Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>Just browsing through your portfolio stopping at images that are interesting to me. Here the dramatic lighting overhead and forward of the model is used for good dramatic effect here! Great shadows in all the right places. The facial expression and the pose give off the feel of hardened executive power. Tho chair is a great prop with the rollers at the bottom.</td>', 'Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad!  Just browsing through your portfolio stopping at images that are interesting to me. Here the dramatic lighting overhead and forward of the model is used for good dramatic effect here! Great shadows in all the right places. The facial expression and the pose give off the feel of hardened executive power. Tho chair is a great prop with the rollers at the bottom.', '2012-12-02 19:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
